  "description": "The proposal involves the conversion of the existing two-bedroom duplex flat above the ground-floor butcher shop at 338 Norwood Road into two self-contained one-bedroom flats. This includes a first-floor one-bedroom flat for one person with a small rear extension, and a one-bedroom flat for two persons across the second floor and a new mansard roof extension. Bicycle storage and refuse/recycling facilities are proposed at ground-floor level, along with altered access and a new internal staircase to serve the upper-floor flats. No change is proposed to the existing ground-floor commercial use."
